    "end": 215.73333333333332,
    "zoom": 1.0,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0.025,
    "label": "ILLUSTRATIVE SCENARIO",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 44,
    "block": 4,
    "segment": 4,
    "asset": "08",
    "source_asset_role": "16",
    "voiceover": "We should not pretend every ancient group behaved alike.",
    "start_frame": 6472,
    "frames": 114,
    "start": 215.73333333333332,
    "end": 219.53333333333333,
    "zoom": 1.0,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0.025,
    "label": "ILLUSTRATIVE SCENARIO",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 45,
    "block": 4,
    "segment": 4,
    "asset": "08",
    "source_asset_role": "16",
    "voiceover": "Researchers studying Neanderthals argue that care for injured people could make an important contribution to survival.",
    "start_frame": 6586,
    "frames": 200,
    "start": 219.53333333333333,
    "end": 226.2,
    "zoom": 1.13,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "ILLUSTRATIVE SCENARIO",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 46,
    "block": 4,
    "segment": 4,
    "asset": "08",
    "source_asset_role": "16",
    "voiceover": "The evidence includes injuries that healed while the person continued living.",
    "start_frame": 6786,
    "frames": 139,
    "start": 226.2,
    "end": 230.83333333333334,
    "zoom": 1.0,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0.025,
    "label": "ILLUSTRATIVE SCENARIO",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 47,
    "block": 4,
    "segment": 5,
    "asset": "08",
    "source_asset_role": "16",
    "voiceover": "That is a stronger clue than any scene we invent.",
    "start_frame": 6925,
    "frames": 126,
    "start": 230.83333333333334,
    "end": 235.03333333333333,
    "zoom": 1.0,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0.025,
    "label": "ILLUSTRATIVE SCENARIO",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 48,
    "block": 4,
    "segment": 5,
    "asset": "08",
    "source_asset_role": "16",
    "voiceover": "So let us leave our traveller by the fire and meet someone whose bones actually survived.",
    "start_frame": 7051,
    "frames": 200,
    "start": 235.03333333333333,
    "end": 241.7,
    "zoom": 1.13,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "ILLUSTRATIVE SCENARIO",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 49,
    "block": 5,
    "segment": 1,
    "asset": "17",
    "source_asset_role": "17",
    "voiceover": "At Shanidar Cave, in what is now Iraq, archaeologists found the remains of a Neanderthal known as Shanidar One.",
    "start_frame": 7251,
    "frames": 237,
    "start": 241.7,
    "end": 249.6,
    "zoom": 1.0,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0.025,
    "label": "SHANIDAR 1 · ILLUSTRATIVE RECONSTRUCTION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 50,
    "block": 5,
    "segment": 1,
    "asset": "17",
    "source_asset_role": "17",
    "voiceover": "His case takes us beyond an imagined accident and into a body that carried its injuries for years.",
    "start_frame": 7488,
    "frames": 224,
    "start": 249.6,
    "end": 257.06666666666666,
    "zoom": 1.13,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "SHANIDAR 1 · ILLUSTRATIVE RECONSTRUCTION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 51,
    "block": 5,
    "segment": 2,
    "asset": "18",
    "source_asset_role": "18",
    "voiceover": "His skeleton records several serious injuries.",
    "start_frame": 7712,
    "frames": 77,
    "start": 257.06666666666666,
    "end": 259.6333333333333,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "SHANIDAR 1 · ILLUSTRATIVE RECONSTRUCTION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 52,
    "block": 5,
    "segment": 2,
    "asset": "18",
    "source_asset_role": "18",
    "voiceover": "Researchers describe damage around the left eye, a severely impaired right arm, and a healed fracture in the right foot.",
    "start_frame": 7789,
    "frames": 249,
    "start": 259.6333333333333,
    "end": 267.93333333333334,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "SHANIDAR 1 · ILLUSTRATIVE RECONSTRUCTION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 53,
    "block": 5,
    "segment": 2,
    "asset": "18",
    "source_asset_role": "18",
    "voiceover": "Yet he lived into adulthood, with age at death estimated around thirty-five to forty-five.",
    "start_frame": 8038,
    "frames": 175,
    "start": 267.93333333333334,
    "end": 273.76666666666665,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "SHANIDAR 1 · ILLUSTRATIVE RECONSTRUCTION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 54,
    "block": 5,
    "segment": 3,
    "asset": "19",
    "source_asset_role": "19",
    "voiceover": "That does not tell us every treatment he received. It does not let us name the people who helped.",
    "start_frame": 8213,
    "frames": 237,
    "start": 273.76666666666665,
    "end": 281.6666666666667,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "SHANIDAR 1 · ILLUSTRATIVE RECONSTRUCTION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 55,
    "block": 5,
    "segment": 3,
    "asset": "19",
    "source_asset_role": "19",
    "voiceover": "It does show that the injuries were not all immediate death sentences.",
    "start_frame": 8450,
    "frames": 151,
    "start": 281.6666666666667,
    "end": 286.7,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "SHANIDAR 1 · ILLUSTRATIVE RECONSTRUCTION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 56,
    "block": 5,
    "segment": 4,
    "asset": "20",
    "source_asset_role": "20",
    "voiceover": "His survival is widely interpreted as evidence of support from others. The skeleton gives us injuries and healing.",
    "start_frame": 8601,
    "frames": 224,
    "start": 286.7,
    "end": 294.1666666666667,
    "zoom": 1.0,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0.025,
    "label": "SHANIDAR 1 · ILLUSTRATIVE RECONSTRUCTION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 57,
    "block": 5,
    "segment": 4,
    "asset": "20",
    "source_asset_role": "20",
    "voiceover": "The daily work of care has to be reconstructed more cautiously.",
    "start_frame": 8825,
    "frames": 139,
    "start": 294.1666666666667,
    "end": 298.8,
    "zoom": 1.13,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "SHANIDAR 1 · ILLUSTRATIVE RECONSTRUCTION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 58,
    "block": 5,
    "segment": 5,
    "asset": "20",
    "source_asset_role": "20",
    "voiceover": "Still, the cartoon of prehistory where everyone simply abandons the injured is already looking shaky.",
    "start_frame": 8964,
    "frames": 188,
    "start": 298.8,
    "end": 305.06666666666666,
    "zoom": 1.0,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0.025,
    "label": "SHANIDAR 1 · ILLUSTRATIVE RECONSTRUCTION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 59,
    "block": 5,
    "segment": 5,
    "asset": "20",
    "source_asset_role": "20",
    "voiceover": "And another discovery takes the question further. What if part of a leg was gone?",
    "start_frame": 9152,
    "frames": 188,
    "start": 305.06666666666666,
    "end": 311.3333333333333,
    "zoom": 1.13,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "SHANIDAR 1 · ILLUSTRATIVE RECONSTRUCTION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 60,
    "block": 6,
    "segment": 1,
    "asset": "21",
    "source_asset_role": "21",
    "voiceover": "In Liang Tebo cave, on the island of Borneo, researchers uncovered a burial about thirty-one thousand years old.",
    "start_frame": 9340,
    "frames": 224,
    "start": 311.3333333333333,
    "end": 318.8,
    "zoom": 1.0,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0.025,
    "label": "LIANG TEBO · RESEARCH INTERPRETATION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 61,
    "block": 6,
    "segment": 1,
    "asset": "21",
    "source_asset_role": "21",
    "voiceover": "The young adult inside was missing the left foot and part of the lower left leg.",
    "start_frame": 9564,
    "frames": 200,
    "start": 318.8,
    "end": 325.46666666666664,
    "zoom": 1.13,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "LIANG TEBO · RESEARCH INTERPRETATION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 62,
    "block": 6,
    "segment": 2,
    "asset": "22",
    "source_asset_role": "22",
    "voiceover": "Missing bones alone would not prove surgery. Bodies can be disturbed after burial.",
    "start_frame": 9764,
    "frames": 163,
    "start": 325.46666666666664,
    "end": 330.9,
    "zoom": 1.0,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0.025,
    "label": "LIANG TEBO · RESEARCH INTERPRETATION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 63,
    "block": 6,
    "segment": 2,
    "asset": "22",
    "source_asset_role": "22",
    "voiceover": "Here, the researchers examined something more revealing: changes in the surviving leg bones.",
    "start_frame": 9927,
    "frames": 163,
    "start": 330.9,
    "end": 336.3333333333333,
    "zoom": 1.13,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "LIANG TEBO · RESEARCH INTERPRETATION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 64,
    "block": 6,
    "segment": 3,
    "asset": "23",
    "source_asset_role": "23",
    "voiceover": "They identified extensive healing and argued that the person had lived for at least another six to nine years",
    "start_frame": 10090,
    "frames": 237,
    "start": 336.3333333333333,
    "end": 344.23333333333335,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "LIANG TEBO · RESEARCH INTERPRETATION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 65,
    "block": 6,
    "segment": 3,
    "asset": "23",
    "source_asset_role": "23",
    "voiceover": "after the injury, which probably happened in childhood.",
    "start_frame": 10327,
    "frames": 102,
    "start": 344.23333333333335,
    "end": 347.6333333333333,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "LIANG TEBO · RESEARCH INTERPRETATION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 66,
    "block": 6,
    "segment": 4,
    "asset": "24",
    "source_asset_role": "24",
    "voiceover": "Their interpretation, published in Nature in twenty twenty-two, was deliberate surgical amputation.",
    "start_frame": 10429,
    "frames": 151,
    "start": 347.6333333333333,
    "end": 352.6666666666667,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "LIANG TEBO · RESEARCH INTERPRETATION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 67,
    "block": 6,
    "segment": 4,
    "asset": "24",
    "source_asset_role": "24",
    "voiceover": "If correct, that places a successful operation astonishingly far back in time.",
    "start_frame": 10580,
    "frames": 151,
    "start": 352.6666666666667,
    "end": 357.7,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "LIANG TEBO · RESEARCH INTERPRETATION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 68,
    "block": 6,
    "segment": 5,
    "asset": "24",
    "source_asset_role": "24",
    "voiceover": "But the bones do not preserve the operator's name, the instrument, or a recipe for managing pain.",
    "start_frame": 10731,
    "frames": 212,
    "start": 357.7,
    "end": 364.76666666666665,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "LIANG TEBO · RESEARCH INTERPRETATION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 69,
    "block": 6,
    "segment": 5,
    "asset": "24",
    "source_asset_role": "24",
    "voiceover": "And there is a twist the headline often leaves out: other specialists challenged the diagnosis.",
    "start_frame": 10943,
    "frames": 188,
    "start": 364.76666666666665,
    "end": 371.03333333333336,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "LIANG TEBO · RESEARCH INTERPRETATION",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 70,
    "block": 7,
    "segment": 1,
    "asset": "25",
    "source_asset_role": "25",
    "voiceover": "In a published response, orthopaedic surgeons proposed a different explanation involving a severe fracture during growth.",
    "start_frame": 11131,
    "frames": 200,
    "start": 371.03333333333336,
    "end": 377.7,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "PUBLISHED DEBATE · 2023",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 71,
    "block": 7,
    "segment": 1,
    "asset": "25",
    "source_asset_role": "25",
    "voiceover": "They argued that the skeletal changes did not require a deliberate operation.",
    "start_frame": 11331,
    "frames": 151,
    "start": 377.7,
    "end": 382.73333333333335,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "PUBLISHED DEBATE · 2023",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 72,
    "block": 7,
    "segment": 2,
    "asset": "25",
    "source_asset_role": "26",
    "voiceover": "The original researchers defended their conclusion.",
    "start_frame": 11482,
    "frames": 77,
    "start": 382.73333333333335,
    "end": 385.3,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "PUBLISHED DEBATE · 2023",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 73,
    "block": 7,
    "segment": 2,
    "asset": "25",
    "source_asset_role": "26",
    "voiceover": "They said the location and form of the damage did not match that proposed fracture, and maintained that amputation best explained what they observed.",
    "start_frame": 11559,
    "frames": 298,
    "start": 385.3,
    "end": 395.23333333333335,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "PUBLISHED DEBATE · 2023",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 74,
    "block": 7,
    "segment": 3,
    "asset": "24",
    "source_asset_role": "27",
    "voiceover": "Here is the difficult part. A bone can show that an injury healed.",
    "start_frame": 11857,
    "frames": 163,
    "start": 395.23333333333335,
    "end": 400.6666666666667,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "PUBLISHED DEBATE · 2023",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 75,
    "block": 7,
    "segment": 3,
    "asset": "24",
    "source_asset_role": "27",
    "voiceover": "Reconstructing exactly what caused it is another question. Surviving a terrible injury and proving an operation are different claims.",
    "start_frame": 12020,
    "frames": 237,
    "start": 400.6666666666667,
    "end": 408.56666666666666,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "PUBLISHED DEBATE · 2023",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 76,
    "block": 7,
    "segment": 4,
    "asset": "24",
    "source_asset_role": "27",
    "voiceover": "We also cannot fill the missing details with a magical leaf, a miracle ointment, or an exact survival percentage.",
    "start_frame": 12257,
    "frames": 237,
    "start": 408.56666666666666,
    "end": 416.46666666666664,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "PUBLISHED DEBATE · 2023",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 77,
    "block": 7,
    "segment": 4,
    "asset": "24",
    "source_asset_role": "27",
    "voiceover": "A dramatic possibility is still a possibility that has to answer to the bones.",
    "start_frame": 12494,
    "frames": 175,
    "start": 416.46666666666664,
    "end": 422.3,
    "zoom": 1,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "PUBLISHED DEBATE · 2023",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 78,
    "block": 7,
    "segment": 5,
    "asset": "08",
    "source_asset_role": "28",
    "voiceover": "And none of this makes a broken leg safe. It gives us a more interesting answer than instant doom.",
    "start_frame": 12669,
    "frames": 237,
    "start": 422.3,
    "end": 430.2,
    "zoom": 1.0,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0.025,
    "label": "PUBLISHED DEBATE · 2023",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 79,
    "block": 7,
    "segment": 5,
    "asset": "08",
    "source_asset_role": "28",
    "voiceover": "Injury, survival, skill, and help could exist in the same world.",
    "start_frame": 12906,
    "frames": 139,
    "start": 430.2,
    "end": 434.8333333333333,
    "zoom": 1.13,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "PUBLISHED DEBATE · 2023",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 80,
    "block": 8,
    "segment": 1,
    "asset": "29",
    "source_asset_role": "29",
    "voiceover": "Back at our imaginary camp, there is no guarantee of a happy ending. A severe injury could kill.",
    "start_frame": 13045,
    "frames": 224,
    "start": 434.8333333333333,
    "end": 442.3,
    "zoom": 1.0,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0.025,
    "label": "ILLUSTRATIVE SCENARIO",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 81,
    "block": 8,
    "segment": 1,
    "asset": "29",
    "source_asset_role": "29",
    "voiceover": "An injury could heal badly. Someone might survive with lasting pain or a different way of moving.",
    "start_frame": 13269,
    "frames": 212,
    "start": 442.3,
    "end": 449.3666666666667,
    "zoom": 1.13,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "ILLUSTRATIVE SCENARIO",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 82,
    "block": 8,
    "segment": 2,
    "asset": "13",
    "source_asset_role": "30",
    "voiceover": "But look at what changed after that first crack. Other people found him. Shelter became reachable. Food kept arriving.",
    "start_frame": 13481,
    "frames": 237,
    "start": 449.3666666666667,
    "end": 457.26666666666665,
    "zoom": 1.0,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0.025,
    "label": "ILLUSTRATIVE SCENARIO",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 83,
    "block": 8,
    "segment": 2,
    "asset": "13",
    "source_asset_role": "30",
    "voiceover": "The world did not become gentle. He stopped facing every part of it alone.",
    "start_frame": 13718,
    "frames": 175,
    "start": 457.26666666666665,
    "end": 463.1,
    "zoom": 1.13,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5,
    "move": 0,
    "label": "ILLUSTRATIVE SCENARIO",
    "timing_status": "estimated_not_audio_aligned"
  },
  {
    "shot": 84,
    "block": 8,
    "segment": 3,
    "asset": "07",
    "source_asset_role": "31",
